"name": "BrightView Holdings, Inc.",
"description": "BrightView Holdings, Inc. is an investment company, which engages in the provision of commercial landscaping services. It operates through the following segments: Maintenance Services and Development Services. The Maintenance Services segment focuses on primarily self-performing through national branch networks and is route-based in nature. The Development Services segment offers sophisticated design, coordination and installation of landscapes at some of the most recognizable corporate, athletic and university complexes and showcase highly visible work that is paramount to customers\u2019 perception of the brand as a market leader. The company was founded on November 7, 2013 and is headquartered in Blue Bell, PA.",
